                                                "sense_id": "679b71e9-7bf4-3384-82a7-9d104d43591b",
                                                "text": "... is that the educators out there aren't aware of this, they don't know it or what?\nMs. Bolinger. It's like na na na na boo boo, make me do it.\n[Laughter.] ..."
                                            },
